                                                "sense_id": "86f2ef35-ecc9-3086-b6ec-a3e8ab58065d",
                                                "text": "He’d been hearing rumours lately of carfentanil in the supply line, which terrified him: one hundred times stronger than fentanyl, approved for the sole purpose of tranquilizing elephants."
                                            }
                                        ]
